===Etymology===
Latinate variant of [[Lucy]], or today borrowed from modern Italian .Name of a Sicilian martyr, {{L.}} Lucia, feminine form of the Roman [[praenomen]] [[Lucius]], from {{term|lux|lang=la}} "light".

